# GludioClericStand's clan-attacked hook on Aden's standing cleric (35250), whose MAGIC_HEAL
# is the shipped Aden Heal (4115): as GludioCleric's, but it heals a hurt clan mate only from
# where it stands. The calls of the hits that leave the knight (35235) at 270 of 440 (61%)
# leave it idle; at 260 (59%), with a draw under 20, it wants to cast its heal on the knight
# without walking, weight 1000000, and casts it at its next think.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioClericStand
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioHold
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioKnight
npc knight 35235 SiegeGuard 100 0 0 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300
npc stand 35250 SiegeGuard 100 -150 0 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300 skill MAGIC_HEAL 4115 1

hit knight 170
  desires stand -

hit knight 10
  desires stand -

hit knight 10
  desires stand cast(knight,4115)=1000000

tick x2
  S MagicSkillUse caster=stand target=knight skill=4115-1 hit=13214 reuse=26428 success=0
